  "title": "Suffix IT Limited : Software Company in Bangladesh",
  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nProvident Fund Management System\nPersonal Information Management\n\nSave deeply, detailed information about your employees. Get the exact, clear idea associated with distinctive employee profiles in order to configure a sensible account holder.\n\nConfigurable Chart of Account\n\nImprove your accounting system by using SuffixPF smart application features. Configure CoA based on your accounting system.\n\nFlexibility to integrate with third party Payroll System\n\nA complete Provident Fund Management System with the ability to integrate with any payroll management system.\n\nKey Features\nConfigurable Refund Policy\nConfigurable Refund Policy\n\nIncrease your refund skills using SuffixPF’s smart application features. Set up role-based refunds according to service and month.\n\nPF Loan Management\nPF Loan Management\n\nEffortlessly manage PF Loan. Configure your application to loan recovery schedule automatically and calculate interest on loan amount.\n\nPF Profit Calculation & Distribution\nPF Profit Calculation & Distribution\n\nConfigure your application to automatically calculate profit on investment within a specified period, including contributions as a provident fund. And distribute profit to employee account by a single click.\n\nPF Investment Management\nPF Investment Management\n\nEffortlessly manage PF Investment. Configure your application to automatically calculate interest percentages of each investment within a specified period.\n\nSchedule a Live Demo\nGo for a free practical demonstration in order to experience the user friendly platform of Suffix Field Force Management.\nREQUEST FOR A DEMO\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
